WEBVTT

00:02:29.756 --> 00:02:32.036
But then he has another
and another and another.

00:02:32.036 --> 00:02:34.396
And I thought to myself, yep.

00:02:34.396 --> 00:02:37.996
And he said he becomes very antisocial
where he doesn't want to ask for help

00:02:38.036 --> 00:02:40.396
and he definitely doesn't want
to talk to anybody.

00:02:40.396 --> 00:02:42.036
And I thought to myself, yep.

00:02:42.036 --> 00:02:45.396
And I realized what I was going
through was trauma.

00:02:45.436 --> 00:02:49.116
And I was afraid to use
the D-word, depression,

00:02:49.156 --> 00:02:51.516
for fear that that was some
sort of diagnosis.

00:02:52.076 --> 00:02:54.716
I think a lot of people
are afraid of that word,

00:02:54.756 --> 00:02:56.836
but that's exactly
what I was going through.

00:02:56.836 --> 00:02:59.036
I was going through 
lowercase “D” depression.

00:02:59.116 --> 00:03:02.916
And I followed the rule
that we set with our friends